  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "The accounts of the hub: sign-in with Google and Discord through Supabase Auth (browser, server and proxy helpers), the account a user makes of what the provider gives, the safe way back after a sign-in, and the demo account of development. The app imports it; it never imports core or a game.",
